{"articleNo":"2032","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2032&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012/2013 이스라엘 정부초청 장학생 선발 요강","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.09.23","hit":"8565","attachments":[{"name":"2012,2013 이스라엘 정부초청 장학생 선발요강.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2032&attachNo=70011"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><font size=\"2\">2012-2013 이스라엘 정부초청 장학생을 아래와 같이 선발하오니, 우리 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.&nbsp;<br></font><br><strong>※ <span lang=\"EN-US\">2012/2013 </span>이스라엘 정부초청 장학생 선발 요강<span lang=\"EN-US\">\n</span></strong></font></span></p><p></p><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>\n</strong></font></span><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">\n</span></p><p><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1. </span>장학 과정</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp; </span></span>가<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>단기 과정<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (3-4</span>주간 지급<span lang=\"EN-US\">)<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp; </span></span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>- </span>하계어학과정 <span lang=\"EN-US\">(Ulpan Akiva </span>또는<span lang=\"EN-US\"> Ulpan of Haifa University)</span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp; </span></span>나<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>장기 과정<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (</span>최장<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 8</span>개월간 지급<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>① 박사후과정</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>② 연구 과정</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>③ 박사학위 과정</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>④ 석사학위 과정</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>⑤ 외국인학생 프로그램</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>※ ①<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>②<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>③<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>④<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>⑤의 순으로 우선 선발 </font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">\n</span></p><p><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2. </span>기본 자격 요건</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>가<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>한국 국적 소지자로서 만<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 35</span>세 미만인 자 </font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>나<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>문학사 또는 이학사 이상의 학위 소지자로서<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>학업성적이 우수한 자</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>영어 또는 히브리어 실력을 갖춘 자 </font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>라<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>지원하는 이스라엘 대학이 요구하는 학업요건을 갖춘 자</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">마<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>심신이 건강한 자</font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">\n</span></p><p><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">3. </span>장학 조건<span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>가<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>부분장학금은 의료보험료와 등록금 또는 생활비 지급</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>(</span>학위과정중 일년<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>총<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 8</span>개월간 지급<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>나<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>전액장학금은 의료보험료<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>등록금<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>생활비 모두 지급</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>숙박비<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>교통비<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>항공료 등은 본인 부담</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>※장학금 지급 조건은 이스라엘 정부 예산 사정에 따라 매년 달라질 수 있음</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>라<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>이스라엘 정부가 지정한 대학에 지원하는 경우에만 장학금이<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp; </span></span>지급됨<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>※이스라엘정부장학생 수용 주요 대학 목록</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\">Tel Aviv University, The Hebrew University, Haifa University, Bar Ilan University, Ben-Gurion University, Technion, Bezalel School for Art, The Volcanic Center/Agricultural Research Organization, and the Weitzmann Institute.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></font></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">\n</span></p><p><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">4. </span>제출 서류 </font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">※ 지원서 양식은 주한이스라엘대사관홈페이지<span lang=\"EN-US\"> http://seoul.mfa.gov.il</span>에서 다운받아 사용할 것</font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\">가<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>지원서<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (</span>소정양식<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\">나<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>연구계획서<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (</span>수학하고자 하는 이스라엘 내의 대학<span lang=\"EN-US\">/</span>전공 분야를 명시<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>이력서</font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">라<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>이스라엘 대학이나 담당교수와 교신한 서신 사본</font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 40pt; mso-char-indent-count: 4.0\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">※박사후과정<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>연구과정 지원자의 경우만 해당</font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">마<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>대학 졸업증명서 및 성적증명서 원본</font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\">바<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>지도교수 추천서<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>최소한<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 2</span>명<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">사<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>사진<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 3</span>장</font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\">아<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>건강진단서<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>소정양식<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0; mso-para-margin-left: 1.0gd\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\">자<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>영어공인성적<span lang=\"EN-US\">(TOEFL, GRE, GMAT, IELTS, etc.) </span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-char-indent-count: 3.0; mso-para-margin-left: 1.0gd\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">또는 히브리어성적<span lang=\"EN-US\">(Ulpan </span>성적표 등<span lang=\"EN-US\">) </span>제출</font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">\n</span></p><p><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">5. </span>기타 유의 사항</font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>가<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>모든 서류는 <strong>영어로<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 3</span>부를 작성</strong>하여 주한이스라엘 대사관에 <strong>우편제출함</strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">. (</span>방문접수는 불가함<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>나<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>최종 발표는<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 2012</span>년<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 5</span>월 예정이며<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>합격자는 개별적으로 연락할 예정임<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>지원 마감일<span lang=\"EN-US\">: 2011.11.30</span>일<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (30</span>일 도착분 까지 접수<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>라<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>참조 웹사이트<span lang=\"EN-US\">: http://seoul.mfa.gov.il</span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>마<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>문의처<span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span>주한이스라엘 대사관 학술과 </font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 65pt; mso-char-indent-count: 6.5\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\">전화<span lang=\"EN-US\">: 02-3210-8510, </span>이메일<span lang=\"EN-US\">: dcm-sec@seoul.mfa.gov.il </span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>바<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>접수처<span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span>서울시 종로구 서린동<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 149</span>번지 청계<span lang=\"EN-US\">11</span>빌딩 <span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>층 </font></font></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2